 class=\"umx-figure-text\"> \n          \u003Cp class=\"umx-figure-title\">\u003Cspan>50\u003C/span>个蔡司镜头进入太空\u003Cbr>记录人类伟大时刻\u003C/p> \n         \u003C/div> \n         \u003Cfigure class=\"umx-history-f1 lazy-imageom\">\u003C/figure> \n        \u003C/div> \n        \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-figure\"> \n         \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-figure-text\"> \n          \u003Cp class=\"umx-figure-title\">全球\u003Cspan>80%\u003C/span>的微芯片\u003Cbr>都是由带有蔡司光学镜头的 \u003Cbr class=\"umx-mb-show\">ASML 光刻机制造\u003C/p> \n         \u003C/div> \n         \u003Cfigure class=\"umx-history-f2 lazy-imageom\">\u003C/figure> \n        \u003C/div> \n        \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-figure\"> \n         \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-figure-text\"> \n          \u003Cp class=\"umx-figure-title\">蔡司镜头\u003Cspan>3\u003C/span>次\u003Cbr>获得奥斯卡科学工程奖\u003C/p> \n         \u003C/div> \n         \u003Cfigure class=\"umx-history-f3 lazy-imageom\">\u003C/figure> \n        \u003C/div> \n        \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-figure\"> \n         \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-figure-text\"> \n          \u003Cp class=\"umx-figure-title\">\u003Cspan>1902\u003C/span>年\u003Cbr>蔡司设计出小巧而强大的天塞镜头\u003Cbr>为手机摄影奠定了基础\u003C/p> \n         \u003C/div> \n         \u003Cfigure class=\"umx-history-f4 lazy-imageom\">\u003C/figure> \n        \u003C/div> \n       \u003C/div> \n      \u003C/div> \n     \u003C/div> \n    \u003C/div> \n   \u003C/div> \n   \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-stage zeiss-joint umx-stage_sticky\"> \n    \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-section\"> \n     \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-title\"> \n      \u003Cp class=\"umx-main-title\">强强联合，\u003Cbr>迈向影像新高度\u003C/p> \n     \u003C/div> \n    \u003C/div> \n    \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-stickyBox\"> \n     \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-joint-list\"> \n      \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-figure-wrapper\"> \n       \u003Cfigure class=\"umx-figure-item umx-joint-f1 lazy-imageom\"> \n        \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-joint-text-mb\"> \n         \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-joint-text-content\"> \n          \u003Ch2 class=\"umx-joint-text-title\">未来研究\u003C/h